%description:
The cell of IndoorFactory_FixedLosUeAboveClutterTolerated, an InF-SH UE antenna at 2.5 m over 2 m
clutter with tolerateHeightViolation set, with the LOS state drawn (dynamicLos = true): the LOS
probability of TR 38.901 Table 7.4.2-1 has k_subsce = -d_clutter / ln(1 - r) * (hBS - hUT) /
(hc - hUT), which is negative here and gives no probability. Its first evaluation is an error
that names the LOS probability, whatever tolerateHeightViolation says.

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
network = simu5g.test.moduletest.lib.NrSessionTestNetwork

# an InF-SH cell (base station antenna at 25 m, above the 2 m clutter) and a UE antenna at 2.5 m
**.radio.scenario = "INDOOR_FACTORY_SH"
*.ue[*].cellularNic.antenna.mobility.offsetZ = 2.5m
**.nrChannelModel[*].tolerateHeightViolation = true
**.dynamicLos = true

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%exitcode: 1
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stderr
and the LOS probability (its k_subsce has (hBS - hUT) / (hc - hUT)) of the scenario INDOOR_FACTORY_SH is defined only where the UE antenna is below the base station antenna and below the clutter height of 2 m (clutterHeight)
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
